WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:15,500
My husband recently had his lap tonsil with a tumor removed on Hunch because of lymphoma.

00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:22,660
He has been 13 days down and just getting off the pain meds and able to return to normal

00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,660
foods.

00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:26,580
They remain swelling in the neck and lymph nodes.

00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:32,720
When may he return to the hyperbaric oxygen treatment, high dose vitamin C drips and

00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,580
far infrared sauna treatments.

00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,580
Thank you kindly.

00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:38,140
I would say you can start those now.

00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,140
For sure.

00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:43,580
I don't think you have any issue with hyperbaric oxygen, I don't think you have any issue with

00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,580
the vitamin C drips.

00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:49,220
The only thing that you might have issue with is the infrared sauna because it is increasing

00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:57,220
your temperature and can increase some inflammation temporarily.

00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:58,620
So just watch that.

00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:03,180
If you feel like you're getting a little swelling, I would go slow on the sauna.

00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,580
That's all I would say.

00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:08,900
But otherwise everything else you could go ahead and take.

00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:12,740
And praying for him, I know he was going to go ahead with that surgery so I'm so glad

00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:13,780
that he's doing well.

